                            	   379: ;==============================================================================
                            	   380: ; FM patch tables (private mp_ prefix — no conflict with audio_driver.asm)
                            	   381: ; Stay in "text" section (no section switch) so PC-relative lea stays within
                            	   382: ; ±32KB of the code that references these tables. audio_driver.asm does the
                            	   383: ; same: its patch tables live in "text" with no section change.
                            	   384: ;==============================================================================
                            	   385:     even
                            	   386: mp_FM_PATCH_REGS:
00:000002A6 B0              	   387:     dc.b    $B0
